      <h3>Hostel Life: From Comfort Zone to Reality</h3>
      <p>My first night at the UET hostel was a whirlwind of emotions. Being away from my family for the first time felt overwhelming. Surrounded by unfamiliar faces and a new environment, I spent the night reflecting on this transition. It was challenging, but it marked the start of my journey towards self-reliance.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="point-section">
