      <h3>The First Day: Nervous Starts & New Faces</h3>
      <p>Stepping into the department the next morning brought a mix of fear and excitement. From searching for classrooms to the initial awkward introduction sessions with classmates, the day moved quickly. What started as hesitation soon turned into the first sparks of friendship as we navigated our lecture schedules together.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="point-section">
