    <div class="point-content">
      <h3>Campus Discovery & Senior Interactions</h3>
      <p>The day ended with a full tour of the university. We explored the library, the mosque, and the playgrounds. A memorable moment was our first encounter with seniors at the café, where we had lighthearted introductions and small tasks. By the time we returned to the hostel, the "new" world had already started feeling a bit more like home.</p>
